                <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M5.293 7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0L10 10.586l3.293-3.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414l-4 4a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 010-1.414z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
            </svg>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer" role="region">
            <p>The tool connects to Google Search Console API, pulls 16 months of page-level click data, identifies each page's peak traffic month, compares it to the trailing 3-month average, and computes a decay score. Pages with a score above 30% are flagged as at-risk.</p>
        </div>
